Upi
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 91 DEAL COLUMN
COLUMN 7 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 2 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 2 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 2 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
AND
    SRC Rank K
    AND
        DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS}
        DEST Suit {CLUBS, DIAMONDS, SPADES}
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
